WEBVTT

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.890
At this hour?

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.940
I can't say I admire workaholics.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:28.320
Well...

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.280
I left something in my office.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.110
I didn't notice until I got home.

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:35.860
Home, huh?

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:38.160
And so you came back?

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.120
You got me.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.830
You shouldn't overdo it.
You're not young anymore.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:47.710
You and me both.
I'll buy you a coffee later.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:49.840
Thanks,

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.010
but Sarah already got me one.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:54.760
Sarah?

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.300
She came to check out
the security footage.

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:01.270
She wanted to look for a scarf she lost.

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:04.810
She was upset because it was a gift
from her boyfriend.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:11.780
Sounds like a lucky guy.

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:28.540
Hey.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:32.710
Who is this?

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:40.050
Robert Walter. Lawyer.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.020
Have you heard of him?

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:52.980
You know him?

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:56.570
I've never met him, but he's the lawyer...

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:00.530
who negotiated the Morrison settlement.

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:02.950
What about him?

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:06.910
Oh, I just found it in the box,

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:09.880
and it seemed unrelated
to the LIVE Corporation.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:16.630
This is a company
that Steven acquired privately.

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:21.300
But after this incident,

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:24.560
he scaled back
and eventually shut it down.

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.560
Although, a part of its operation

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:30.600
was taken over
by LIVE's transportation division.

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:33.940
So, it was a LIVE subsidiary.

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:39.820
More accurately, I'd say Steven
was the one pulling the strings.

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:43.450
And this man was a lawyer there.

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:36.710
I guess I could tackle these.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.410
I had some work piled up.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:04.330
Do you want to join me on my break?

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:08.630
Fred met Monica through Anna.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:12.760
He reached out to Monica
to help him indict LIVE.

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:18.050
How does LIVE connect to Monica?

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.310
What could it be?

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:26.020
They're all too distant from Monica.

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:28.940
How did LIVE...

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:36.360
track Monica's movements?

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:40.620
When are you going to loosen up?

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:42.540
Not while I'm working.

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:43.790
I'll get canned.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.460
That's the footage Sarah was watching.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.670
I got curious
since she said she didn't find it.

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:59.180
But I didn't see her scarf either.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:04.060
Maybe I'll go take a look around, too.

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:05.980
You have an idea?

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:07.640
Monica's office.

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:10.150
Sarah cleaned it out, didn't she?

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:13.400
I bet she dropped it then.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:16.860
You're not the boss for nothing.

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:21.200
The two of them were close.

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:00.320
Finding darkness...

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.280
in broad daylight.

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:35.980
In front of...

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:38.150
Sarah.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:43.490
Are you finished?

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.330
Yes, thank you.

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:48.750
I'm happy I could help.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:50.830
Find anything good?

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:52.580
Yeah...

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:56.670
This is where my real work begins.

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:07.970
<i>The number you have dialed</i>
<i>cannot be reached.</i>

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:27.740
<i>The number you have dialed</i>
<i>cannot be reached.</i>

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:28.660
Come on!

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:30.830
<i>-We never found</i>
-The Masks...

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.580
<i>-a way to control its power</i>
-are unfinished?

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:33.960
<i>or eliminate the side effects.</i>

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:35.670
So many have had to suffer.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:37.880
<i>It needed to be shut down.</i>

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:41.590
<i>Eddy, we'll be transporting</i>
<i>a material witness there.</i>

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:44.760
<i>-My brother is still consumed by it.</i>
-Okay, be careful.

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:45.680
<i>Science...</i>

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:48.680
<i>Science should never lose sight</i>
<i>of morality.</i>

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:49.760
Sarah?

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.860
James is with Fred right now.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.530
-You found him?
<i>-Thankfully.</i>

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.540
We're bringing him in
as a material witness.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:15.960
We're almost at the end.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:20.420
We are going to solve this case.

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:25.930
<i>We will.</i>

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:28.430
Did you find anything, Sarah?

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.350
Isn't that why you called?

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.930
Yes, I just came from
the newspaper company...

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:36.140
where I realized something.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:41.770
Damn it.

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:52.740
-You mean...?
-Yes, I'm afraid so.

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:58.120
Sarah, if what you're saying is true,
then you have to be careful!

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.170
I know!

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.340
I know, but...

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:49.320
Mo--

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:02.870
Sarah?

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:04.500
What's going on?

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.460
I'm sorry, I know it's late.

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:09.510
There's something I wanted to ask.

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:13.220
Would you walk with me?

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:50.170
You could've called me
if it was an emergency.

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:54.090
I thought it would be best
to talk to you directly.

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:06.230
Then how about that pub we walked past?

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:21.540
What is it?

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:23.700
I...

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.710
I really admired Monica.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:32.300
I always wanted to become a prosecutor...

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:34.800
like she was.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:40.390
"When your emotions take control,
you lose sight of what you should do."

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:44.060
She'd always warn me with those words.

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:49.690
I wouldn't be who I am now without her.

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:53.150
-Sarah.
-I...

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:55.780
I was there when it happened,

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:58.110
and now I am sure of it.

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:03.830
Robert.

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.040
Monica didn't die.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.420
She was killed.

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:17.930
Sarah, what are you saying?

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:21.430
She was killed.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:26.850
I know how much you idolized her,

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:30.900
and how hard it must be to accept,

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:32.440
but this is going too far.

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:34.610
She was killed.

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:38.450
By LIVE Corporation.

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:43.280
What...

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:45.080
What are you saying?

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.660
LIVE? That military company?

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:51.630
Why would they kill Monica?

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.550
That is ridiculous.

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:17.610
A few months ago,

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:21.410
Monica met a certain researcher
at a function.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:23.240
After some time,

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:25.580
he reached out to her for help.

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:27.950
It was to indict LIVE.

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:31.420
And so, Monica began looking into LIVE.

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:36.300
Someone as good as Monica was careful
about staying under the radar.

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:39.970
But sadly, that wasn't the case this time.

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:44.930
There was someone near her
connected to LIVE.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:46.600
Damn it.

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:49.350
That person was...

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:52.270
Sarah!

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:56.980
Robert, I believe that was you.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:09.950
So, are you saying that I joined LIVE
and killed Monica?

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.130
Back when you were a lawyer,

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:17.090
you brought a case to settlement.

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:21.800
You're talking about the shipping
accident for one of LIVE's subsidiaries.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:26.100
You're accusing of being connected to LIVE
just from that?

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:28.640
That doesn't prove anything!

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.100
You're right, it doesn't.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:34.100
But that was enough of a reason
to search for proof.

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:37.770
Right now,

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.740
<i>someone from the SSC</i>
<i>is investigating your home.</i>

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:49.120
I am betting someone like you
has kept evidence of LIVE's crimes...

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:51.620
as insurance.

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:58.040
Found it.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:10.220
Error?

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:18.730
You've got it wrong.

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:23.240
This has to be some mistake.

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:25.200
You have to believe me.

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:28.740
Do I look like someone who could do that,
Sarah?

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:39.460
<i>Sarah, your boss...</i>

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:45.090
He's guilty.

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:51.350
No, it was all just a mistake.

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:52.810
I knew it.

00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:57.350
Monica.

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:08.530
Sarah!

00:24:19.410 --> 00:24:21.910
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
